  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_HoloLens_Utilities_Calibration\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Ñawi tupuchina ruwachiy
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_HoloLens_Utilities_CalibrationDescription\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: HoloLens ñawikunaykipaq allichay. Kay allichan imayna allinlla hologramakuna rikunki, kaykuna aswan confortable qawanapaq ruwan, chaymanta kay iñisqa tinkinakunawan yanapan. Allin tukusqakunapaq, ñawi tupuchina sapa kuti huk musuq runa kay dispositivota ruwan.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Holographic_Uninstall\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Windows Mixed Reality urquy
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Holographic_UninstallWarning\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Ñawpaq urquchkan, chiqaqchay uyarichiqkunayki PC kaqniykimanta tukuchiy chaymanta Chaqrusqa Sullull Punkuta wichqay.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Holographic_UninstallDescription\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Sichus Windows Mixed Reality mana allinlla llamkanckan utaq sichus wakin muyuq kampu munanki, urquyta atikunki. Kayta ruwaqpa willayninta qichuy chaymanta Windows Mixed Reality kutimuy ñawpaqchasqa tupachiyninman, ichaqa ñawpaq churasqa chaqrusqa sullull llamkanakuna computadoraykipi qichun.

Watiqmanta Windows Mixed Reality kaqta qallariypaq ruwachkan, Qallariy > Chaqrusqa Sullull Punku kaqmanta.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Holographic_UninstallDescription2\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Sichus Windows Mixed Reality mana allinlla utaq muyuq kampupi manam qullqiyuq munanki, urquy chanta watiqmanta churay (Qallariyman riy chaymanta Chaqrusqa Sullull Punku akllay). Ruwaq willayniykita waqaychakuptintaq urquchkan, ichaqa chaqrusqa sullull llamkanakuna PC kaqniykipi kanqa.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Holographic_ClearDataDescription\Text:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Dispositivoyki muyuriqniykita hapin asswan allin yachaykuna kananpaq.

 Kay willayta pichaptiykiqa, ichapas winaypi wakin winayqa chinkanman hinaspa tupachisqaykipa patanta manaña qawawaqchu. Patan musuqmanta paqarichinapaq, PCniykipi Qallariy > Chaqrusqa Sullull Punku kaqman hanparaykipi riy > Tupachiyta ruwachiy.
