  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicStartupAndDesktop_DesktopViewAutoLaunch2\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Hanpara qawana llamkanata kichay hanpara llamkana kanchiriptin uyarinata hapiptin.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicStartupAndDesktop_ClassicApps_VirtualMonitorPreallocation\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Ñawpa llamkanakunapaq virtual qawanata paqarichiy chaqrusqa sullullpi qallariptin.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicStartupAndDesktop_ClassicApps_VirtualMonitorPreallocationWarning\Text:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Qallariypi virtual pantalla paqarichiy wañuchiyqa ichapas uyarichiqkunata asta sayarachinman, chaqrusqa sullullpi ñawpa llamkanata qallarichiptiyki.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicStartupAndDesktop_ClassicApps_VirtualMonitorPreallocation2\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Ñawpa llamkanakunapaq virtual qawanata paqarichiy chaqrusqa sullullpi qallariptin
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicStartupAndDesktop_ClassicApps_Group_Description\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Windows Chaqrusqa Sullullqa ñawpaq llamkanakunapaq yanapayniyuqmi. Chaypaqmi, Windows virtual qawanakunata hapin kay llamkanakuna wasipi chaqursqa sullullpi qawachinapaq. Ichaqa, kay virtual qawanakunaqa ichapas virtual qawanata pisiyachinman, achka kiki qawanakuna kaptin. 

Virtual qawana qallariypi paqarichiyta wañuchiptiykiqa, uyarinapa qawananqa tukuqlla sayanmanmi chaqrusqa sullullpi ñawpa llamkanakuna qallariptin.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicStartupAndDesktop_ClassicApps_Group_DescriptionLabel\Text:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Windows Mixed Reality nisqaqa ñawpa llamkanakunapaq sinchi yanapayniyuqmi. Chaypaq Windows virtual qawanakunata hapin wasipi kay llamkanakuna chaqrusqa sullullpi qawachinanpaq. Ichaqa, kay virtual qawanakunaqa ichapas qawanaykipaq, aswanqa achka qawanayuq kaptin.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicStartupAndDesktop_ClassicApps_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Ñawpa llamkanakuna
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicStartupAndDesktop_AutomaticStartup_Group_DescriptionLabel\Text:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Windows nisqaqa Chaqrusqa Sullull Punkupim kikillanmanta qallarichinman utaq uyarichiqta hapiptiyki. Chaqrusqa Sullull Punkuqa chaqrusqa sullullpaq ruwasqa llamkanata hapiptiykim sapa kuti qallarin.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicStartupAndDesktop_AutomaticStartup_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Kikillanmanta qallariy
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicStartupAndDesktop_AutomaticStartup_Group\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Windows kikillanmantam Chaqrusqa Sullull Chawpita qallarichinman uyarinakunata tinkichiptin utaq churakuptin
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicSpeechAndAudio_Speech_UseSpeechCommands\Text:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Rimasqata riksiqta Windows Mixed Reality kaqpi ruway yapa dictasqa chaymanta tupaq llamkanakunawan rimay kamachiqkunawan ruwachkanku. Rimasqata riksiq uyarichkanpuni mayk’aq chaqrusqa sullull ruwachkan.

Sichus auricularniyki kawsarichisqan chaymanta tinkisqa rimasqata riqsiq wak yachaykunawan kawsarichisqan,  kayhina Cortana utaq Dictasqa Windows, llapa parlanki Microsoft puyu kasqa rimasqata riksiqnipi yanapakuyniman apachiyku. Rimay willayniykita ruwayku yanapaypaq rimasqa yanapakuykunayku allichay. Sichus mana llapa parlanki Microsoft kaqman apachikunqa munankichu sichus auricularkunayki kawsarichin, Rimasqata riksiq tupachiyta kay rapipi wañuchiy manaraq tinkisqa rimasqata riksiq kawsarichinapaq.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicSpeechAndAudio_Speech_SpeechCommandsDisabled\Text:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Kunanlla akllasqa runasimipi mana hapirinalla kanchu
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicSpeechAndAudio_Speech_MixedRealityLink\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Chaqrusqa sullul imayna hapiy
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicSpeechAndAudio_Speech_LearnMoreLink\Content:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Yachay imayna chaqrusqa sullull rimaypi hapiy
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicSpeechAndAudio_Speech_ChangeOnlineSpeechSetting\Content:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Tinkisqa rimasqata riksiq tupachiyta tikray
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicSpeechAndAudio_Speech\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Rimasqata riksiq
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicSpeechAndAudio_SpeechSettingsLink\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Tinkisqa rimasqata riksiq tupachiy
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicSpeechAndAudio_SpeechRecognition_Description\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Rimasqa riqsiqqa sapa kutim rimasqaykita uyarinqa, llamkanakunata rimaywan kamachisqaykitapas.

Rimasqa riqsiy tinkisqapi kawsarichisqa kaptinqa huk Windows yachaykunapi, Cortana utaq Windows Qillqachiy nisqapas, llapan nisqaykim rimasqa riqsiy yanapakuy Microsoft puyuman apachikunqa. Llapan nisqayki rimasqa riqsiyman uyarinta hapiptiyki mana apachikunanta munaptiykiqa, kay rapipi rimasqa riqsiy tinkisqapi tupachiyta wañuchiy huk Microsoft llamkanakunapi utaq kaqninkunapi.
